# The root configuration (../.clang-tidy), with one deviation decided by the
# user (2026-10-19, docs/process/workflow.md): in a test the literal is the
# expectation, written where it is checked, and ES.45 (avoid magic
# constants) targets constants in program logic. Everything else applies.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -cppcoreguidelines-avoid-magic-numbers
